# Code Style

## Formatting (Prettier: .prettierrc.json)

- Single quotes, semicolons, 2-space indent, trailing commas (`all`), printWidth 100.
- Exactly ONE empty line between functions and logical blocks; never 2+ consecutive empty lines.
- Every file ends with exactly 1 trailing newline.
- Do not add or remove empty lines unrelated to your change — keep diffs clean.

## TypeScript

- Strict mode is on; no `any` unless interoperating with untyped payloads (prefer `unknown` + narrowing).
- `const` over `let`; never `var`.
- Named exports for utilities; camelCase for variables/functions, PascalCase for types/interfaces.
- Template literals for interpolation; optional chaining (`?.`) and nullish coalescing (`??`) where they aid readability.

## Imports

- Group: node builtins, external packages, workspace packages (`@wildrift-forge/*`), then relative imports.
- Extensionless relative imports (`./client`, not `./client.js`).

## Architecture boundaries

- Riot-specific page structures (blades, `__NEXT_DATA__`, HTML shapes) live ONLY under `apps/scraper/src/sources/riot/`.
- Everything else consumes canonical types from `@wildrift-forge/game-data`.
- Keep recommendation/scoring logic (future `packages/recommendation`) free of Express/Next.js dependencies.
